tural resources, striving for the smallest possible environmental footprint while crafting high-quality products.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["subheading_3K9qTp","richtext_K8Yn4P"],"settings":{"color_scheme":"scheme-1","image_size":"lg","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Green_Field.jpg","content_width":"lg","enable_parallax":true,"remove_vertical_spacing":true}},"image_with_text_94i9dU":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"subheading_eRifU4":{"type":"subheading","disabled":true,"settings":{"text":"Subheading"}},"heading_qTLxdD":{"type":"heading","settings":{"text":"What moves us","heading_tag":"h2"}},"richtext_4V78JL":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"content":"<p>Athloun is inspired by three powerful forces: When we look up, we see our young achievers—their ambitions fuel our purpose. When we look down, we see the hands that craft our vision—our workers, whose lives we aim to uplift. When we look around, we find nature—its elegance shaping our choices.<\/p><p>We are much more than a brand. We are a way of life.<\/p>"}},"richtext_HkMTqt":{"type":"richtext","disabled":true,"settings":{"content":"<p>Use this text to share information about your brand with your customers. Describe a product, share announcements, or welcome customers to your store.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["subheading_eRifU4","heading_qTLxdD","richtext_4V78JL","richtext_HkMTqt"],"settings":{"color_scheme":"scheme-2","separate_section_with_border":false,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Screenshot2024-10-20at4.33.12PM.png","mobile_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Screenshot2024-10-20at4.33.12PM.png","reveal_on_scroll":true,"image_position":"start","content_width":"lg","remove_vertical_spacing":true}},"image_with_text_CGYPDa":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"subheading_8MaaaG":{"type":"subheading","disabled":true,"settings":{"text":"Subheading"}},"heading_CLDfNM":{"type":"heading","settings":{"text":"Our Commitment","heading_tag":"h2"}},"richtext_EJiAAE":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"content":"<p>At Athloun, we craft versatile, plant-based clothing that supports you all day. Committed to connecting with movement, nature, mindfulness, and community, we believe in making real progress toward a low-climate future. <\/p><p>Performance redefined: simplify, achieve, and live your best moments.<\/p><p>Join us in creating meaningful change. <\/p>"}},"richtext_FarYmL":{"type":"richtext","disabled":true,"settings":{"content":"<p>Use this text to share information about your brand with your customers. Describe a product, share announcements, or welcome customers to your store.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["subheading_8MaaaG","heading_CLDfNM","richtext_EJiAAE","richtext_FarYmL"],"settings":{"color_scheme":"scheme-2","separate_section_with_border":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/natural-white-cotton-crumpled-soft-fabric-texture-background-surface_2.jpg","mobile_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/natural-white-cotton-crumpled-soft-fabric-texture-background-surface_2.jpg","reveal_on_scroll":true,"image_position":"end","content_width":"lg","remove_vertical_spacing":true}},"image_with_text_Hwbn96":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"subheading_ygPXHm":{"type":"subheading","settings":{"text":""}},"heading_zRCJT3":{"type":"heading","settings":{"text":"Investment in Wellness","heading_tag":"h2"}},"richtext_RhYGRw":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"content":"<p>Athloun blends the space between work, play, travel, and relaxation. Crafted for the dynamic lives of young achievers, each Athloun piece supports physical and emotional well-being. <\/p><p>We follow human-centric design approach aiming towards a lifestyle that balances movement and mindfulness. <\/p>"}}},"block_order":["subheading_ygPXHm","heading_zRCJT3","richtext_RhYGRw"],"settings":{"color_scheme":"scheme-080c1727-6f95-4618-afd7-718864cc40a0","separate_section_with_border":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/freepik__high-resolution-sharp-bright-defines-__90982.png","mobile_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/freepik__high-resolution-sharp-bright-defines-__90982.png","reveal_on_scroll":true,"image_position":"start","content_width":"sm","remove_vertical_spacing":true}},"image_with_text_bifPiW":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"subheading_XVnB48":{"type":"subheading","settings":{"text":""}},"heading_e4gqiL":{"type":"heading","settings":{"text":"Our Products","heading_tag":"h2"}},"richtext_G9BjyJ":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"content":"<p>We are committed to a sustainable future, focusing on reducing natural resource use across sourcing, production, and the entire supply chain. As of 2024, nearly 100% of our fabrics and finishes are plant-based. <\/p><p>We support a circular economy, minimise water and chemical footprints, and prioritise responsible innovation for a healthier planet. <\/p>"}},"button_wiDJW7":{"type":"button","settings":{"style":"solid","text":"Shop Now","url":"https:\/\/athloun.com\/collections\/all","background":"","text_color":""}}},"block_order":["subheading_XVnB48","heading_e4gqiL","richtext_G9BjyJ","button_wiDJW7"],"settings":{"color_scheme":"","separate_section_with_border":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/WhatsApp_Image_2025-03-05_at_17.02.47_17157e64.jpg","reveal_on_scroll":true,"image_position":"end","content_width":"sm","remove_vertical_spacing":true}},"image_with_text_WCdMyw":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"subheading_EJqVjQ":{"type":"subheading","settings":{"text":""}},"heading_6bMjc4":{"type":"heading","settings":{"text":"Impact ","heading_tag":"h2"}},"richtext_yeENVn":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"content":"<p>Athloun is committed to a clean closet, cleaner planet. Our journey began with a vision to weave sustainability into every thread, driven by our commitment to the planet and its people. <\/p><p>We replace harmful chemicals and virgin polyester with natural, plant-based textiles. Each piece is crafted with the wearer in mind, aiming to minimize our ecological footprint.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["subheading_EJqVjQ","heading_6bMjc4","richtext_yeENVn"],"settings":{"color_scheme":"","separate_section_with_border":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/MOUNTAIN_LOGO.jpg","reveal_on_scroll":true,"image_position":"start","content_width":"sm","remove_vertical_spacing":true}},"image_with_text_KBpNxm":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"subheading_Tk8UXn":{"type":"subheading","settings":{"text":""}},"heading_eMerGH":{"type":"heading","settings":{"text":"Our People","heading_tag":"h2"}},"richtext_Q3gUyj":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"content":"<p>We foster a culture where all our people can thrive, from our HQ to partner factories. All vendors follow Code of Conduct, based on SLCP standards. <\/p><p>We are committed to helping our team live extraordinary lives by investing in their health, happiness, and growth, ensuring they are supported in both work and personal relationships.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["subheading_Tk8UXn","heading_eMerGH","richtext_Q3gUyj"],"settings":{"color_scheme":"","separate_section_with_border":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/WhatsApp_Image_2026-03-22_at_9.23.55_PM.jpg","reveal_on_scroll":true,"image_position":"end","content_width":"sm","remove_vertical_spacing":true}},"rich_text_9Ejkhf":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"subheading_iCaDdE":{"type":"subheading","settings":{"text":""}},"heading_ryUkAH":{"type":"heading","settings":{"text":"Ourselves","heading_tag":"h2"}},"richtext_zqcNVg":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"content":"<p>Our guiding principles are clear - create exceptional products, nurture meaningful relationships, and lead extraordinary lives. We commit to transparency in our products, processes, and ethics, offering clear supply chain visibility and upholding data privacy. We also take responsibility for our environmental impact, sharing our vision, goals, and progress with our community every step of the way.<\/p>"}},"image_kXjqza":{"type":"image","settings":{"width_mode":"custom","max_width":600,"mobile_max_width":400}}},"block_order":["subheading_iCaDdE","heading